# Westerly Winds with its SoA era module (modules/era/lua/missions/mission_adjustments.lua, RESTRICT_CONTENT 1,
# ENABLE_SOA 0): the 3028 finish, on a completion, deletes the note, sets A Mercenary Life's must-zone flag (the local
# var) and its Timer var (1 until JST midnight). Status 1 (a GM) with the note: 3028, finished: completed, note
# deleted, Timer 1, flag set.
module modules/era/lua/missions/mission_adjustments.lua
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/Naja_Salaheem/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/3028
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=40,-6,-30 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Toau WesterlyWinds current
keyitem RaillefalsNote
setting RESTRICT_CONTENT 1
setting ENABLE_SOA 0
login
missionstatus Toau 1                    # a GM
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # 3028
finish                                  # completed; Timer 1
